            "body": {
              "output": {
                "messages": [
                  {
                    "content": "[{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"**CLAIM DECISION: APPROVED**\\n\\n**Reasoning:**\\nLisinopril is a first-line ACE inhibitor for hypertension and heart failure management. It is included on Tier 1 (preferred generic) of the standard formulary with no prior authorization required for standard dosing and supply durations.\\n\\nA 30-day supply falls within normal dispensing limits for maintenance medications.\\n\\n**Formulary Reference:**\\nSection 4.2.1 - Cardiovascular Agents, ACE Inhibitors (Tier 1 Preferred Generics)\\n\\n**Claim Status:** APPROVED for processing\\n**Member:** MEM-001\\n**Drug:** Lisinopril \\n**Supply:** 30-day supply\\n\\nThe claim may proceed to standard copay calculation based on the member's benefit plan.\"}], \"finish_reason\": \"end_turn\"}]",
                    "role": "assistant"
                  }
                ]
